    "备份超过 100 MB，未能导出。清理「最近删除」和「同步保留版本」，或减少照片封面后再试。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The backup is over 100 MB, so it wasn’t exported. Clear Recently Deleted and Saved Sync Versions, or use fewer photo covers, then try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "备份超过 100 MB，未能导出。清理「最近删除」和「同步保留版本」，或减少照片封面后再试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "備份超過 100 MB，未能匯出。清理「最近刪除」和「同步保留版本」，或減少照片封面後再試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」的文字过长，无法上传到 iCloud；其他日子照常同步。缩短它的笔记后会再上传。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” has too much text to upload to iCloud; other days still sync. It will upload once its note is shorter."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%@」的文字过长，无法上传到 iCloud；其他日子照常同步。缩短它的笔记后会再上传。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%@」的文字過長，無法上傳到 iCloud；其他日子照常同步。縮短它的筆記後會再上傳。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "分类「%@」的数据过大，无法上传到 iCloud；其他内容照常同步。" : {
