    "今天也要好好生活，珍惜每一个值得记住的日子。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Cherish today and every day worth remembering." } },
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "今天也要好好生活，珍惜每一个值得记住的日子。" } },
        "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "今天也要好好生活，珍惜每一個值得記住的日子。" } }
      }
    },
    "每日问候由系统重复，占用 1 个名额。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The system repeats the daily greeting, using one reminder slot." } },
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "每日问候由系统重复，占用 1 个名额。" } },
        "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "每日問候由系統重複，佔用 1 個名額。" } }
      }
    },
    "公历与农历最多预排未来 %lld 年，按时间保留最早 %lld 条（含每日问候）；日子较多时范围会缩短。农历日期限于 1900–2100 年。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Gregorian and lunar reminders are scheduled up to %lld years ahead. Only the earliest %lld reminders, including the daily greeting, are kept, so more days shorten the coverage. Lunar dates are limited to 1900–2100." } },
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "公历与农历最多预排未来 %lld 年，按时间保留最早 %lld 条（含每日问候）；日子较多时范围会缩短。农历日期限于 1900–2100 年。" } },
        "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "公曆與農曆最多預排未來 %lld 年，按時間保留最早 %lld 條（含每日問候）；日子較多時範圍會縮短。農曆日期限於 1900–2100 年。" } }
      }
    },
