    "仅删除这份本机保留版本，删除后无法撤销。当前日子、分类、其他保留版本和已导出的备份不受影响。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only this saved local version will be deleted. This cannot be undone. Your current days, categories, other saved versions, and exported backups are not affected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅删除这份本机保留版本，删除后无法撤销。当前日子、分类、其他保留版本和已导出的备份不受影响。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只會刪除此本機保留版本，刪除後無法復原。目前的日子、分類、其他保留版本和已匯出的備份不受影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅支持农历 1900 至 2100 年。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lunar dates are supported from 1900 through 2100 only."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅支持农历 1900 至 2100 年。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "僅支援農曆 1900 至 2100 年。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅追加本机未见过的记录，不覆盖已有记录。旧版数据可能包含曾在其他设备删除的日子；所有设备请升级后再编辑。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only records not previously seen on this device will be added. Existing records will not be overwritten. Legacy data may include days deleted on other devices. Update all devices before editing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅追加本机未见过的记录，不覆盖已有记录。旧版数据可能包含曾在其他设备删除的日子；所有设备请升级后再编辑。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只會新增本機未曾見過的記錄，不會覆寫現有記錄。舊版資料可能包含曾在其他裝置刪除的日子；請先更新所有裝置，再進行編輯。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
