    "当前 %lld 个日子将被备份中的 %lld 个日子替换，并同步到其他设备。替换前会保留本机副本。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This will replace the days on this device (%1$lld) with the days in this backup (%2$lld) and sync them to your other devices. A local copy is kept first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当前 %lld 个日子将被备份中的 %lld 个日子替换，并同步到其他设备。替换前会保留本机副本。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "目前的 %lld 個日子將被備份中的 %lld 個日子取代，並同步到其他裝置。取代前會保留本機副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "当前模拟器构建不启用 iCloud 同步，请在配置开发者团队后的签名真机上验证。本机数据不受影响。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud sync is disabled in simulator builds. Verify sync on a signed physical device with a configured developer team. Local data is unaffected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当前模拟器构建不启用 iCloud 同步，请在配置开发者团队后的签名真机上验证。本机数据不受影响。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
