    "iOS 通常会在后台续排提醒；很久不打开 App 时，打开一次一定能补上。单日「不提醒」也不参与年度回忆。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS usually renews the schedule in the background, and opening the app always does. Days set to “No reminders” are also left out of yearly memories."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS 通常会在后台续排提醒；很久不打开 App 时，打开一次一定能补上。单日「不提醒」也不参与年度回忆。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS 通常會在背景續排提醒；很久不開啟 App 時，開啟一次一定能補上。單日「不提醒」也不參與年度回憶。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
