    },
    "早期版本把日子和分类另存了一份在 iCloud 键值存储中。清除后，仍在使用早期版本的设备将读不到这些日子；本机日子不受影响。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Early versions kept another copy of your days and categories in iCloud key-value storage. Once it’s cleared, devices still on an early version can’t read those days. The days on this device are not affected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "早期版本把日子和分类另存了一份在 iCloud 键值存储中。清除后，仍在使用早期版本的设备将读不到这些日子；本机日子不受影响。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
